- current main advanced to `683a3fd97db6ff7903d1619438932110790791c6`;
- existing Vercel project `uberbondd` auto-deployed that exact main SHA as production deployment `dpl_7MicJQSe4FEqkzybRGxQo6hSNc6u`, state READY;
- `https://uberbondd.vercel.app/api/health` returned HTTP 200 with `storeBackend: postgres`;
- unauthenticated `GET /api/agent-mesh-cron` returned HTTP 401, confirming the production cron route is present and fail-closed;
- no authenticated cron canary was attempted because available tooling does not expose `CRON_SECRET`, and no credential change is authorized;
